<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-RIETUMU INDEX UP 0.06 PCT TO 150.64.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-RIETUMU INDEX UP 0.06 PCT TO 150.64.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Rietumu index inched up on Thursday by 0.06 percent to 150.64, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 722 66 93</p>
